    {"key": "story.intro.1", "text": "Under the old workshop, the cellar keeps going down."},
    {"key": "story.intro.2", "text": "No one dug it. It grew, one Keeper at a time."},
    {"key": "story.intro.3", "text": "Each went down with a satchel, a bench, and a Book."},
    {"key": "story.intro.4", "text": "At the bottom they made something, and planted it."},
    {"key": "story.intro.5", "text": "The last Keeper went down and did not come back up."},
    {"key": "story.intro.6", "text": "The bench is yours now. The Book is empty."},
    {"key": "story.intro.7", "text": "Each depth asks for a stronger brew. Nothing down here is labelled."},
    {"key": "story.intro.8", "text": "The Book will remember what your hands forget."},
    {"key": "story.intro.9", "text": "So mix. Watch what happens. Remember."},
    {"key": "story.ending.1", "text": "At the bottom of everything: a seed."},
    {"key": "story.ending.2", "text": "It hums with every reaction that came before it."},
    {"key": "story.ending.3", "text": "Plant it, and the cellar will grow a little deeper."},
