    {"key": "tutorial.1_1", "text": "This is the bench. Nine tiles. Materials go on them."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_2", "text": "Click Ember Coal, then the lit tile."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_3", "text": "Put Deep Tear next to it. Neighbours react."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_4", "text": "Changed your mind? Click a placed material to take it back."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_5", "text": "Ignite."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_6", "text": "New: Steam Wisp. The number is its potency, your score."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_6b", "text": "Potency: what you made, times one less than the materials used, doubled the first time, times the chain step."},
    {"key": "tutorial.1_7", "text": "What you make is kept on the rack, ready for later."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_1", "text": "Not every pair reacts. Try Glowmoss beside Iron Ore."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_2", "text": "Ignite."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_3", "text": "Nothing reacted. The trial is spent, the materials come back. But a hint was left on Glowmoss's page."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_4", "text": "Open the Journal."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_5", "text": "Every reaction you find is written here, kept across runs. Steam Wisp is in it already."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_6", "text": "The number is the Reaction Index, 1 to 10. It decides who reacts first. Ember Coal is a 9."},
    {"key": "tutorial.2_7", "text": "Glowmoss reacts with a Potion. The hint stays until found."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_0", "text": "Redraw swaps the materials in your hand. Two per depth."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_1", "text": "One reaction can set off the next. Lay Iron Ore, Ember Coal, Moondust in a row."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_2", "text": "Highest Reaction Index goes first. That is Ember Coal, 9."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_3", "text": "Ignite."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_4", "text": "Sky Iron was new, and it touched Moondust. Hot enough now, so they reacted too. That is a chain."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_5", "text": "Step 2 counts twice. Step 3 would count three times. Long chains are where the potency is."},
    {"key": "tutorial.3_6", "text": "Without Moondust the chain stops at step 1: 40, not 280."},
    {"key": "tutorial.5_1", "text": "Depth cleared. Pick a catalyst. It helps all run long."},
    {"key": "tutorial.5_2", "text": "Each one says what it does. Point at one to read it."},
    {"key": "tutorial.5_3", "text": "Take one."},
    {"key": "tutorial.5_4", "text": "See the difference? That is your catalyst."},
    {"key": "tutorial.5_5", "text": "That is all there is to teach. Nothing is labelled from here. Mix, watch, remember."},
